:: Maze 1
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

You turn right, and continue through the maze of corridors. Holes appear in the walls, as if bricks have been dislocated. If they have, they're no where to be seen.
<br><br>
You peer into the one of the holes. Several pairs of yellow eyes stare back. You hear a hiss.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

The corridor forks up ahead.
<br><br>

<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 1 0]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 1 1]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Maze 0 0
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

You turn left, your feet slow and steady on the thickening mucus.
<br><br>

<<if $eventskip isnot 1>>
	<<maze_basilisk>>
<<else>>
	There are gaps in the ceiling. Slime oozes through them, dripping down and soaking the floor.
	<br><br>
	<<if $hallucinations gte 2 and $settings.slimesEnabled>>
		<<if $rng gte 51>>
			A dribble of mucus lands on your shoulder. You look up, and see a slime fall from the ceiling.

			<<dancedifficulty 1 1000 true>>
			<<if $danceSuccess>>
				<span class="green">You spring to the side,</span> avoiding it as it falls. Two more drop after it, and squirm closer.
				<br><br>
			<<else>>
				<span class="red">It lands on your chest before you can move away,</span> knocking you on your back. Two more drop after it, and squirm closer.
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			A dribble of slime lands on the ground in front of you. Three slimes drop from the ceiling, and advance towards you.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Next|Maze 0 0 Slime]]>><<set $struggle_start to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<if $rng gte 51>>
			A dribble of slime lands on your shoulder. You look up, and see a large dollop of mucus falling from the ceiling.
			<<dancedifficulty 1 1000 true>>
			<<if $danceSuccess>>
				<span class="green">You spring to the side,</span> avoiding it as it splats onto the ground. You continue through the corridors.<<outergoo>>
				<br><br>
			<<else>>
				<span class="red">It lands on top of you before you can move away,</span> knocking you on your back and covering you with slimy fluid.
				<br><br>
				You manage to pry yourself off the floor, and continue.
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			A dribble of slime falls on the floor ahead of you. You look up, and see a large dollop fall after it. You step around it, and continue through the corridors.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 0 0 0]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 0 0 1]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

:: Maze 0 0 Slime
<<effects>>

<<if $struggle_start is 1>>
	<<struggle_init>>
	<<set $struggle.creature to "slime">>
	<<struggle_creatures 3 2>>/*How many creatures will be involved, and their health.*/
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $struggle.chest.creature to "slime">><<set $chestuse to "struggle">><<set $cheststate to "struggle">><<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "chest">>
	<<unset $struggle_start>>
<</if>>

<<struggle>>



<<if $struggle.done gte $struggle.number>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Maze 0 0 Slime End]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Maze 0 0 Slime]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Maze 0 0 Slime End
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

The slimes squirm away, through cracks in the ground. <<tearful>> you rise to your feet.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<loadNPC 0 "basilisk">>

<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 0 0 0]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 0 0 1]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>


:: Maze 0 1
<<effects>>

오른쪽으로 돈다. 두꺼워지는 점액 위에서 발을 헛디디지 않도록 조심한다.
<br><br>
<<if $eventskip isnot 1>>
	<<maze_basilisk>>
<<else>>
	앞 복도가 어둠으로 가득 차 있다. 천장이 다른 곳보다 상태가 좋아 빛이 들어오지 않는 것일 수도 있지만, 잘 보이지 않아 알 수 없다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[조심스럽게 계속하기 (0:30)|Maze 0 1 Care]]>><<pass 30>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[서둘러 통과하기 (0:01)|Maze 0 1 Rush]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>

<</if>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

:: Maze 0 1 Care
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

You peer into the dark for a few moments, letting your eyes adjust. The corridor seems to continue as normal, if a bit slick, but you spot a darker patch on the ground up ahead.
<br><br>

You touch it with your foot. It's a hole, a gap in broken floorboards. You step over, and continue on your way, slow and steady.
<br><br>

You see light up ahead, revealing another fork.
<br><br>

<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 0 1 0]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 0 1 1]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>


:: Maze 0 1 Rush
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

You push ahead across the slick floor. Your eyes will soon adjust to the dark.
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 51>>
	You slide along without issue, until you see a light up ahead, revealing another fork.
	<br><br>

	<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 0 1 0]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 0 1 1]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Several steps later, <span class="red">your foot fails to find the floor.</span> Your stomach lurches as you fall, and your arms reach out. Your fingertips clutch at the broken, creaking floorboards, while your body dangles into an abyss.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Climb!|Maze 0 1 Climb]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Fall|Maze 0 1 Fall]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<</if>>


