You wade out into the cool water, push yourself out, and swim.
<br><br>

<<water>><<waterbr 2>><<effects>>

<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled>>
	Snakes emerge from holes in the stonework, but you're able to outmanoeuvre them.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	Hatches open beneath the water, and hands reach out to grope you, but you're able to manoeuvre beyond their grasp.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $wolfgirl gte 6>>
