:: Maze 1 1 Strip
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
You remove your clothing, and hold it above your head as you wade out into the cool water. You swim with your feet and one arm, keeping your clothes dry with the other.
<br><br>

<<waterbr 2>><<effects>>

<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled>>
	Snakes emerge from holes within the stonework.
	<<if $swimmingSuccess>>
		Even with one arm occupied, <span class="green">you're able to manoeuvre beyond their reach.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<if $wolfgirl gte 6>>
			You emerge from the water, and shake some of the excess from your body.
		<<else>>
			You emerge from the water.
		<</if>>
		There's another fork ahead of you.

		<br><br>
		<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 1 1 0]]>><<clotheson>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 1 1 1]]>><<clotheson>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You try to manoeuvre beyond their reach, <span class="red">but they're too quick.</span> You try to push and kick the snakes away, but there are too many. They twist around your exposed body, squeezing and molesting, dragging your clothes into the water.<<ggarousal>><<arousal 1200>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
		<br><br>
		You gather them up, and escape from the pool. There's another fork ahead of you.
		<br><br>
		<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 1 1 0]]>><<clotheson>><<water>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 1 1 1]]>><<clotheson>><<water>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Hatches open along the sides of the corridor, and hands reach out.
	<<if $swimmingSuccess>>
		Even with one arm occupied, <span class="green">you're able to manoeuvre beyond their reach.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<if $wolfgirl gte 6>>
			You emerge from the water, and shake some of the excess from your body.
		<<else>>
			You emerge from the water.
		<</if>>
		There's another fork ahead of you.

		<br><br>
		<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 1 1 0]]>><<clotheson>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 1 1 1]]>><<clotheson>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You try to manoeuvre beyond their reach, but there's a subtle flow to the water. You push away from the hands on side of the corridor, <span class="red">and end up in the hands on the other side.</span>
		<br><br>
		You try to push and kick them away, but there are too many. They grope and molest your exposed body, making you drop your clothes into the water.<<ggarousal>><<arousal 1200>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
		<br><br>
		You gather them up, and emerge from the water. There's another fork ahead of you.
		<br><br>
		<<mazeIcon "left">><<link [[Go left (0:01)|Maze 1 1 0]]>><<clotheson>><<water>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<mazeIcon "right">><<link [[Go right (0:01)|Maze 1 1 1]]>><<clotheson>><<water>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>



